  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed single storey front extension, replacement of the existing flat roof\r\nwith a pitched roof and associated external alterations would result in a form\r\nof development that is out of character and harmful to the established\r\ncharacter of the area. The cumulative scale, massing and roof form of the\r\nproposal would cause the building to read as a standalone dwellinghouse\r\nencroaching towards the street frontage, rather than retaining the subordinate\r\nappearance of an outbuilding as originally designed as is typical within the\r\nsurrounding context. Therefore, the development would be contrary to the\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 of the London plan and\r\nGR1 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021-2041.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nforward projection and increased visual prominence would disrupt the prevailing\r\nbuilding line, go against the established urban grain and undermine the spatial\r\nopenness and pattern of development that contributes to the character of the\r\nstreet scene. As a result, the development would detract from character and\r\nappearance of the area and would be contrary to the National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2024), Policies D3 of the London plan and GR1 of the Harrow Local\r\nPlan 2021-2041.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
  "decision": "Refused",
